<title>UK: Associates Corp plans $500 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Associates Corp plans $500 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associates Corp of North America plans to launch a five-year bond for up to $500 million, an official at joint lead manager Goldman Sachs International said on Monday.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers International is the other lead manager.</p>
<p>Roadshows for the transaction will take place during the first half of this week with launch expected shortly thereafter.</p>
<p>Syndicate managers away from the leads said a launch spread in the low-40s basis points over U.S. Treasury notes was likely.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to be listed in both Asia and Europe.</p>
<p>-- Aline van Duyn, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
